g-inline--fa fa-copy " role="img" viewBox="0 0 448 512" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M160 64c0-17.7 14.3-32 32-32l132.1 0c8.5 0 16.6 3.4 22.6 9.4l59.9 59.9c6 6 9.4 14.1 9.4 22.6L416 320c0 17.7-14.3 32-32 32l-192 0c-17.7 0-32-14.3-32-32l0-256zM192 0c-35.3 0-64 28.7-64 64l0 256c0 35.3 28.7 64 64 64l192 0c35.3 0 64-28.7 64-64l0-196.1c0-17-6.7-33.3-18.7-45.3L369.4 18.7C357.4 6.7 341.1 0 324.1 0L192 0zM64 128c-35.3 0-64 28.7-64 64L0 448c0 35.3 28.7 64 64 64l192 0c35.3 0 64-28.7 64-64l0-16-32 0 0 16c0 17.7-14.3 32-32 32L64 480c-17.7 0-32-14.3-32-32l0-256c0-17.7 14.3-32 32-32l16 0 0-32-16 0z"></path></svg></span><p class="index-module-scss-module__LupDFW__paragraph index-module-scss-module__LupDFW__level-B4 index-module-scss-module__LupDFW__variant-secondary index-module-scss-module__LupDFW__weight-default">0, 0, 0, 81</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><h2 class="index-module-scss-module__WznaLG__level-6 index-module-scss-module__WznaLG__title index-module-scss-module__WznaLG__variant-primary">About <!-- -->Polbeng</h2><div class="index-module-scss-module__szccRa__space-5" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="index-module___jxigW__companyWrapper"><div class="index-module___jxigW__companyStatement"><div class="index-module-scss-module__jz34vW__box index-module-scss-module__jz34vW__display-block index-module-scss-module__jz34vW__align-left index-module-scss-module__jz34vW__position-relative index-module___jxigW__clamp-10"><p class="index-module-scss-module__LupDFW__paragraph index-module-scss-module__LupDFW__level-B3 index-module-scss-module__LupDFW__variant-secondary index-module-scss-module__LupDFW__weight-default">Polbeng is a renowned brand in Riau, Indonesia, as the only vocational public university in the region under the Ministry of Education and Culture. With a commitment to excellence, Polbeng is leading the way in digitalizing campus facilities to enhance efficiency and support the quality of education. Their aim is to facilitate academic endeavors for students, faculty, and staff<!-- -->.</p><br class="index-module__LcQ79q__hide-sm"/><p class="index-module-scss-module__LupDFW__paragraph index-module-scss-module__LupDFW__level-B3 index-module-scss-module__LupDFW__variant-secondary index-module-scss-module__LupDFW__weight-default">Polbeng offers a comprehensive range of programs and courses in various fields of study, including naval engineering, architecture, mechanical engineering, electrical engineering, civil engineering, business administration, information technology, and more. Each department is equipped with state-of-the-art facilities to ensure a conducive learning environment. In addition, Polbeng provides new student admission guidelines, academic regulations, and online student information systems<!-- -->.</p><br class="index-module__LcQ79q__hide-sm"/><p class="index-module-scss-module__LupDFW__paragraph index-module-scss-module__LupDFW__level-B3 index-module-scss-module__LupDFW__variant-secondary index-module-scss-module__LupDFW__weight-default">They also foster a vibrant student community with various extracurricular activities to enrich students&#x27; college experience. With its commitment to competence and academic excellence, Polbeng continues to make significant contributions to vocational education in Riau</p><div class="index-module___jxigW__overlay-bottom"></div></div><div class="index-module-scss-module__szccRa__space-5" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="index-module-scss-module__jz34vW__box index-module-scss-module__jz34vW__display-block index-module-scss-module__jz34vW__align-left index-module-scss-module__jz34vW__position-static index-module-scss-module__jz34vW__auto-top"><span class="index-module__yLgsXa__anchor index-module__yLgsXa__cursor-pointer index-module__yLgsXa__variant-secondary index-module__yLgsXa__weight-semibold index-module__yLgsXa__size-sm"><span class="index-module-scss-module__r1Ax4q__icon index-module-scss-module__r1Ax4q__gradient-pro index-modu