iv><div class="index-module___jxigW__companyWrapper"><div class="index-module___jxigW__companyStatement"><div class="index-module-scss-module__jz34vW__box index-module-scss-module__jz34vW__display-block index-module-scss-module__jz34vW__align-left index-module-scss-module__jz34vW__position-relative index-module___jxigW__clamp-10"><p class="index-module-scss-module__LupDFW__paragraph index-module-scss-module__LupDFW__level-B3 index-module-scss-module__LupDFW__variant-secondary index-module-scss-module__LupDFW__weight-default">Polbeng is a renowned brand in Riau, Indonesia, as the only vocational public university in the region under the Ministry of Education and Culture. With a commitment to excellence, Polbeng is leading the way in digitalizing campus facilities to enhance efficiency and support the quality of education. Their aim is to facilitate academic endeavors for students, faculty, and staff<!-- -->.</p><br class="index-module__LcQ79q__hide-sm"/><p class="index-module-scss-module__LupDFW__paragraph index-module-scss-module__LupDFW__level-B3 index-module-scss-module__LupDFW__variant-secondary index-module-scss-module__LupDFW__weight-default">Polbeng offers a comprehensive range of programs and courses in various fields of study, including naval engineering, architecture, mechanical engineering, electrical engineering, civil engineering, business administration, information technology, and more. Each department is equipped with state-of-the-art facilities to ensure a conducive learning environment. In addition, Polbeng provides new student admission guidelines, academic regulations, and online student information systems<!-- -->.</p><br class="index-module__LcQ79q__hide-sm"/><p class="index-module-scss-module__LupDFW__paragraph index-module-scss-module__LupDFW__level-B3 index-module-scss-module__LupDFW__variant-secondary index-module-scss-module__LupDFW__weight-default">They also foster a vibrant student community with various extracurricular activities to enrich students&#x27; college experience. With its commitment to competence and academic excellence, Polbeng continues to make significant contributions to vocational education in Riau</p><div class="index-module___jxigW__overlay-bottom"></div></div><div class="index-module-scss-module__szccRa__space-5" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="index-module-scss-module__jz34vW__box index-module-scss-module__jz34vW__display-block index-module-scss-module__jz34vW__align-left index-module-scss-module__jz34vW__position-static index-module-scss-module__jz34vW__auto-top"><span class="index-module__yLgsXa__anchor index-module__yLgsXa__cursor-pointer index-module__yLgsXa__variant-secondary index-module__yLgsXa__weight-semibold index-module__yLgsXa__size-sm"><span class="index-module-scss-module__r1Ax4q__icon index-module-scss-module__r1Ax4q__gradient-pro index-module-scss-module__r1Ax4q__space-right index-module-scss-module__r1Ax4q__size-md"><svg data-prefix="fas" data-icon="sparkles" class="svg-inline--fa fa-sparkles " role="img" viewBox="0 0 576 512" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M391.5 53.2c-4.5 1.7-7.5 6-7.5 10.8s3 9.1 7.5 10.8L448 96 469.2 152.5c1.7 4.5 6 7.5 10.8 7.5s9.1-3 10.8-7.5L512 96 568.5 74.8c4.5-1.7 7.5-6 7.5-10.8s-3-9.1-7.5-10.8L512 32 490.8-24.5c-1.7-4.5-6-7.5-10.8-7.5s-9.1 3-10.8 7.5L448 32 391.5 53.2zm-185 20.1c-2.6-5.7-8.3-9.3-14.5-9.3s-11.9 3.6-14.5 9.3l-53.1 115-115 53.1C3.6 244.1 0 249.8 0 256s3.6 11.9 9.3 14.5l115 53.1 53.1 115c2.6 5.7 8.3 9.3 14.5 9.3s11.9-3.6 14.5-9.3l53.1-115 115-53.1c5.7-2.6 9.3-8.3 9.3-14.5s-3.6-11.9-9.3-14.5l-115-53.1-53.1-115zM416 416l-56.5 21.2c-4.5 1.7-7.5 6-7.5 10.8s3 9.1 7.5 10.8L416 480 437.2 536.5c1.7 4.5 6 7.5 10.8 7.5s9.1-3 10.8-7.5L480 480 536.5 458.8c4.5-1.7 7.5-6 7.5-10.8s-3-9.1-7.5-10.8L480 416 458.8 359.5c-1.7-4.5-6-7.5-10.8-7.5s-9.1 3-10.8 7.5L416 416z"></path></svg></span>Read more...</span></div></div><div class="index-module___jxigW__companyDetailsItems"><div><p class="index-module-scss-module__LupDFW_